        "subject": "LU-19559 lnet: lnet_peer reduce holes reported by pahole",
        "message": "LU-19559 lnet: lnet_peer reduce holes reported by pahole\n\nlnet_peer reduce holes reported by pahole. There\nis no function change introduced by this patch.\n\nBefore:\n\n$ pahole -C lnet_peer lnet/lnet/lnet.o\n/* size: 336, cachelines: 6, members: 33 */\n/* sum members: 317, holes: 4, sum holes: 15 */\n/* padding: 4 */\n/* last cacheline: 16 bytes */\n\nAfter:\n\n$ pahole -C lnet_peer lnet/lnet/lnet.o\n/* size: 320, cachelines: 5, members: 33 */\n/* padding: 3 */\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity-lnet\nSigned-off-by: Arshad Hussain <arshad.hussain@aeoncomputing.com>\nChange-Id: I047148b7518ae08bdf9f0c416945b08b51b4a7f6\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/62174\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\n"
      },
